# Group Vision Plan

@body

- Short Google Form to complete.
- Using an existing idea from a member in the group?
  - Any changes to the company now that you are bringing in new talent.
  - Your choice\: New name? New market? Expand product offering? More specifics into the science, etc.
- Starting a new idea?
  - what is new company name and what market are you going after.

